{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1089.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"9a5ef6830c542c0d215ccac234dd5ef7f0daaf553826f48b57b4eb7f42b23714","ja":"熱烈ファン誕生！？","zh":"狂热粉丝诞生！？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1089.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"11803a07ab93e09afeeae5e41b745c4ab1cf42f4bea250eb18d15386c7e5a79a","ja":"地方イベントでステージに立った響、茜、風花、紬。\nステージ後には、グッズ購入による握手会があって……","zh":"響、茜、风花和紬登上了地方活动的舞台。\n演出结束后，还举行了购买周边即可参加的握手会……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1089.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"217f6e101e0fe795118a21c0a0b886ea153e6d2c25cc919485d452897d54e8aa","ja":"貴方は先程の……。ふふっ♪\n2回も来ていただいて、とても嬉しいです。","zh":"您是刚才的那位……呵呵♪\n承蒙您来了2次，我真的非常高兴。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1089.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"2c53bc41c32f130b5808102567e9b1e9b8fb1e5c9cb967bad9ace1a896eda8c1","ja":"はい、もちろん覚えています。応援していただいて\nありがとうございます。ええ、ではまた。","zh":"是的，我当然记得。非常感谢您的\n支持。嗯，那么再见。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1089.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"a0eb057378d9431d0a828f88106e31f6f338aeaac77da12c14e7f4512f756738","ja":"ふふ、紬ちゃんよかったね。\n今日のライブで、新しいファンの方が増えて。","zh":"呵呵，紬，太好了呢。\n今天的演出上，又多了不少新粉丝。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1089.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"ce81967b75acbcd7703c31e41d54e5924dd7817a4945dfd238873816d53f880e","ja":"はい。不慣れな土地で少々緊張しましたが、\n応援くださる方が増えて嬉しいです。","zh":"是的。虽然在人生地不熟的地方难免有点紧张，\n但能看到支持我的人变多，我很高兴。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1089.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"cd8d5fdfbc876fbc3f424ccd6b1dc4ce77728d1267f36b162cef07a96a24f7d7","ja":"あっ、次の方が……。\nようこそ、白石紬です。","zh":"啊，下一位客人到了……\n欢迎光临，这里是白石䌷。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1089.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"4e501238bff1c348ceeb7792b2d9e4ead08d82543b36e45297aea3a79be148c2","ja":"そして、しばらくして……","zh":"之后，过了一段时间……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1089.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"c392e8f026f9b78206a1e210358f5bcf7197a9b1aff0218bd14654010f971b38","ja":"ありがとうございます。え？　次のライブも来てくれ\nるんですか？　嬉しいです♪　お待ちしていますね。","zh":"非常感谢。咦？下一次演出您也会来\n吗？太让人高兴了♪我会一直恭候您的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1089.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"c8572df06c4358af49e9eb89cf7f91d0022347e231389422d3d75207db6894cb","ja":"……お客さんいっぱい来てくれるわね。\nあっ、ほら見て、紬ちゃん……。","zh":"……来了好多客人呢。\n啊，快看，紬……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1089.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"9d5fcac7857d03726ce6dcc866dc0d7192d7870d2ecbacbf62901e3033f10133","ja":"あっ、あの方は……。","zh":"啊，那位是……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1089.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"ab867c8544edb2ac9b9bd1e489e4d18cab795e6e3cef4a88b207200afcf6a14a","ja":"3回もいらしていただけるなんて光栄です。","zh":"您能光临3次，真是太荣幸了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1089.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"1dccc064e96cb8d8919ca7ff02296e2730604452452cbb05a05e14060cf06e82","ja":"でも、あまり無理はしないでくださいね。\n貴方のお気持ちはしっかり受け取りましたから。","zh":"不过，请不要太勉强自己哦。\n因为您的心意我已经充分感受到了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1089.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"4def7233070da62eab9bea444d430318d633b52b73ffdaa5a2c3ea2105280b82","ja":"それではまた……。","zh":"那么下次再见……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1089.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"831c75a2ad4428bdad47d89217c002e86b32e59f08686a21347e3ea7a406b781","ja":"そう告げたが、ファンの人は\nなかなか手を離さなくて……","zh":"虽然这么说了，但那位粉丝\n却迟迟不肯放手……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1089.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"8544b103c285eedf48f45544a1e796a81bcd63bee628a1362178b948c6d50fa3","ja":"はい、劇場に来ていただけるのは、\nとてもありがたいです。ですがあの、次の方が……。","zh":"是的，您能来到剧场，\n我们非常感激。但是那个，后面的客人……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1089.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"d40be2c9ffc56ef7aa3380098ed03c6db811e266a5573e0a01eb9a9b1ec74b79","ja":"そこでスタッフに促され、\nファンの人はようやくその場を後にした","zh":"于是在工作人员的催促下，\n那位粉丝终于离开了现场","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1089.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"6073a00dd455e2b163d0acacdb7e308dba568139a811fe936fd8142b407b6b44","ja":"……あの人、紬ちゃんの、\nすごく熱心なファンになってくれたみたいね。","zh":"……那个人，好像成了\n小紬非常热心的粉丝呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1089.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"42b9eab1c8360fa2fc7c614f627f28a34a9a566efae7ac2fb78049218d193688","ja":"はい。ですが、\n他の方にご迷惑をかけてしまうのは……。","zh":"是的。但是，\n给其他人添麻烦的话就有点……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
